{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2024-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1727740800, "end_date": 1728431999, "month_true_total": 365, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:00:34 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "176650822", "author": {"steamid": "76561199057970882", "personaname": "一长串数字名是QQ吗", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199057970882/", "num_games_owned": 122, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 14737, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11219, "last_played": 1778860662, "avatar": "e1dde7fe207a397634580d4755f7890ccf24ddd7"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这个游戏很好玩，但是我要唱唱反调，这游戏不适合联机带好几个新人！体验极差！因为你的任务和队友的任务很可能是不一样的，队友和队友的任务也不一定是一样的，如果队伍里有两个以上新人那战役任务进度就推的极慢，这游戏新手主线要肝解锁任务种类，然后要晋升解锁更多东西，再然后要解锁武器，这个过程如果你不收到特殊照顾，几个人轮流推战役任务进度极慢，而且新手打的难度也低，但凡玩的时间长一些，像我，哪怕是被当做小登的存在都会打的无聊，而高难是新手碰不得的，你武器模组都没解锁，怎么打，我直到有了迫击炮和核弹打高难才有意思起来了。说到这个模组，模组是有意思的玩法，但是一直开不到好模组玩那就是没意思，而且有不少模组是要一定的熟练度才强的，甚至是要打辅助mod才是完全体，说到这个mod，更抽象了要去mod.io下，然后游戏里进去的网站没中文，还要你自己去复制到浏览器上翻译，并且这个mod有数量限制而且没人做整合包，只能下一堆杂七杂八的mod，有的mod是真的好用，比如被抓文字提醒，过热条等等，但是有的mod不应该就是官方做出来的效果吗，比如在游戏里的mod栏所搜你下载的mod这个功能要你专门用一个mod才能使用\n\n\n有个傻老外来留言，说什么mod作者没有必要中文，你这mod.io网站不支持中文，是网站，个人作者确实没有必要制作其他语言的翻译，但是整个网站功能都不支持中文，不仅仅是一个游戏的社区，你自己做mod谁管你啊，做的好不论语言都会有大量下载，但是网站的问题会阻挡大量玩家，并且mod.io的问题并不是所有具体的mod的问题，尽管它是一个庞大的网站但是并不能代表所以mod玩家，对网站不满又不是对每一个mod作者提出难以完成的要求，而且如果是指的mod.io网站是个人运营的话，那祝早日卖给epic用，这样不会以后缺钱关闭网站了", "timestamp_created": 1728417224, "timestamp_updated": 1731647153, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.612019002437591553", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176645928", "author": {"steamid": "76561199734956312", "personaname": "李云泽实名上网", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199734956312/", "num_games_owned": 22, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 210, "playtime_at_review": 3914, "last_played": 1788052204, "avatar": "a8e2c88a29ca9c3eb40530870ede490a95e54cb0"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "66666666666666", "timestamp_created": 1728412008, "timestamp_updated": 1728412008, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176634557", "author": {"steamid": "76561198851101258", "personaname": "TistepinY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198851101258/", "num_games_owned": 121, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 3882, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3882, "last_played": 1728399754, "avatar": "7bd8776a739054df07e518449d48b1ccd5fdfebd"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "值得一玩", "timestamp_created": 1728400217, "timestamp_updated": 1728400217, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176633993", "author": {"steamid": "76561199017335467", "personaname": "睡不醒的浔", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199017335467/", "num_games_owned": 69, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 18846, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 105, "playtime_at_review": 5518, "last_played": 1787835683, "avatar": "352186f1359c09be0fb2c7605da84dd321dbd362"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "高难好玩爱玩失败继续玩，刚刚打了一个9+难度的修小骡咂，三个小时真的打爽了，